            "fieldName": "Description",
            "kind": "rich-text",
            "value": "**As a** registered user  \n**I want to** sign in with my email address and password  \n**So that** I can access my account securely\n\n**Scope:** Sign-in form on the Login screen: credentials entry, remember-me and submission.\n\n**Feature:** Authentication · **Persona:** Registered user · **Screens:** Login · **Size:** M\n\n## Preconditions\n\n- The Login screen is displayed\n\n## Postconditions\n\n- The user is signed in\n- The Dashboard screen is displayed\n\n## Business rules\n\n- None\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- Error message wording is inferred; confirm with UX.\n\n## Open questions\n\n- Is single sign-on required?\n\n---\n\n_Generated by Coherence — UC-001 rev 2 · coh-0d98e76fae02_\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n#### SC-01 · App opens (happy path)\n\n```gherkin\nGIVEN the app is installed\nWHEN the user opens the app\nTHEN the Login screen is displayed\n```",
