        "value": "<p><strong>As a</strong> registered user<br><strong>I want to</strong> sign in with my email address and password<br><strong>So that</strong> I can access my account securely</p>\n<p><strong>Scope:</strong> Sign-in form on the Login screen: credentials entry, remember-me and submission.</p>\n<p><strong>Feature:</strong> Authentication · <strong>Persona:</strong> Registered user · <strong>Screens:</strong> Login · <strong>Size:</strong> M · <strong>Depends on:</strong> UC-001</p>\n<h2>Preconditions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Login screen is displayed</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Postconditions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The user is signed in</li>\n<li>The Dashboard screen is displayed</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Business rules</h2>\n<h3>BR-01 · Email address — Email input</h3>\n<p><code>login.email</code></p>\n<p>Single-line email input labelled &quot;Email address&quot; with placeholder &quot;<a href=\"mailto:you@company.com\">you@company.com</a>&quot;.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mandatory; the form cannot be submitted while it is empty.</li>\n<li>Must be a valid email address, max 254 characters.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>BR-05 · Screen-level rules — General</h3>\n<p>Rules that apply to the whole sign-in form.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>After 5 consecutive failed attempts the account is locked for 15 minutes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Assumptions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Error message wording is inferred; confirm with UX.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Open questions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Is single sign-on required?</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><em>Generated by Coherence — UC-003 rev 2 · coh-9cf20c6123b6</em></p>\n<h2>Acceptance criteria</h2>\n<h4>SC-01 · Successful sign-in (happy path)</h4>\n<p><strong>GIVEN</strong> the Login screen is displayed<br>\n<strong>AND</strong> the user has an active account<br>\n<strong>WHEN</strong> the user enters a registered email address in &quot;Email address&quot;<br>\n<strong>AND</strong> the user selects &quot;Sign in&quot;<br>\n<strong>THEN</strong> the user is signed in<br>\n<strong>THEN</strong> the Dashboard screen is displayed</p>"
      },
